# Round 11 — bundled SMALL commercial-OK real-data samples per industry, tracked so the demo + Docker run
# on real data offline (PaySim CC-BY-SA, openSNP CC0 / PGS-Catalog CC-BY, ESA-ADB CC-BY-3.0-IGO). Placed
# LAST so these re-includes win over `data/*` and the `*.csv`/`*.npz` rules above (last match wins).
!data/finance/
!data/genomics/
!data/satellite/
!data/finance/**
!data/genomics/**
!data/satellite/**
# but keep small fixture/sample files explicitly added with `git add -f`

